One nuance: lastUsedStore is set to store. Called before renameCategory. isCategoryInUse can be called with only category name. It will use lastUsedStore if store not passed. That works for isCategoryInUse calls that only have one param (like in code). However there is a type signature: isCategoryInUse(storeOrName: Store | string, name?: string) => Promise<boolean>. They use lastUsedStore fallback.

Potential concurrency issues: The renameCategory function uses store.put for each receipt. It does not use a dedicated update receipt function. It hasn't been defined here, but okay.

