Now if renameCategory fails (invalid name, duplicate, category not found), no receipt's category field may be changed. Implementation: they validate newName: isValidName check; they call syncCategoriesWithReceipts first; then find matches; if no match, return 'Category not found.'; the rename fails before any receipt updates. But the update of receipt may happen after that. They also have catch for errors during receipt updates; in that case they rollback receipts.

